---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow" style="animation-delay: 0ms">
      <span class="pill">Subscription AI Integration</span>
    </div>

    <h1 style="animation-delay: 80ms">
      <span class="gradient-text">AI that finally</span><br />
      works for you
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-sub" style="animation-delay: 160ms">
      They say AI will transform your business, but nobody shows you how.<br />
      <span style="font-weight: 600">SMBuddy</span> is here to help.<br />
      <br />
      <span style="font-weight: 600">We are the handy ones who help you adapt
      <br />to this ever-changing world of AI.</span><br />
      <br />
      We build the actual tools tailored to your needs –<br />
      assistants, automations, integrations, dashboards.<br />
      <br />
      Inside your stack – on a <span style="font-weight: 600">flat monthly subscription</span>.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-ctas" style="animation-delay: 240ms">
      <a href="#booking" class="btn btn-primary">Book intro call</a>
      <a href="#how" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-badges" style="animation-delay: 340ms">
      <span>First result in 24-48h</span>
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>15+ years experience in IT</span>
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span>Your stack, your data</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-5xl) 0 var(--space-4xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 900px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse at center,
      rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18) 0%,
      rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08) 40%,
      transparent 70%
    );
    filter: blur(60px);
    z-index: 0;
    animation: glow-pulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-inner > * {
    animation: hero-fade-up 0.8s var(--ease-out) both;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: 7px 18px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6ba3f7;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  h1 br {
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-xl);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .hero-badges {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .dot {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--text-tertiary);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      padding: calc(var(--space-4xl) + 24px) 0 var(--space-3xl);
    }

    .hero-badges {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
    }

    .dot {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
